   "voice": "Kess Media is a Sydney photography and video agency serving government and infrastructure clients. Professional but human. Lead with the project and what it was for, then a detail from the shoot. Name the client only when the context says the client is public. One quiet call to action at most. LinkedIn gets the fullest version with 3 to 5 hashtags; Instagram a shorter one with up to 8; Facebook none. Australian English. No em dashes. The LinkedIn account labelled \"Alexander Kesselaar (personal)\" is the founder's own profile: write that one in the first person as Alex (\"I\", \"my team and I\"), a little more personal about the shoot, still with 3 to 5 hashtags. The company page stays \"we\".",
